      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "By early 2026, the open source project OpenClaw had become a phenomenon. In January, its GitHub star count crossed 100,000 as developer interest surged. Community dashboards and traffic analytics showed more than 2 million visitors in a single week. By March, OpenClaw topped 250,000 stars — overtaking React to become the most-starred software project on GitHub in just 60 days.",
