      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Created by Peter Steinberger , OpenClaw is a self-hosted, persistent AI assistant designed to run locally or on private servers. The project drew attention for its accessibility and unbounded autonomy: Users could deploy an AI model locally without depending on cloud infrastructure or external application programming interfaces (APIs).",
